{"id":"00148","root":"uni00148_1","name":{"ja":"アンジェ","en":"Ange"},"title":{"ja":"【聖夜のお楽しみ】","en":"【Yuletide Delight】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【聖夜のお楽しみ】 アンジェ","en":"【Yuletide Delight】 Ange"},"aliases":["Angers"],"element":"Science","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2018-12-14","limited":true,"characterId":29,"profile":{"ja":"魔族や対魔忍といった者の力を移植された米連の改造人間。変身などはしないが、敵を葬る時などは背中が展開し、中から無数の触手が放出され敵を殲滅する。改造人間として米連の施設で兵士として育てられた彼女は特殊技能や様々な戦闘経験を積んでいく。集団戦が得意で無数の敵を葬り去っている。自分の周りには常に大人の人しかおらず対等に彼女と接するものが居ないせいもあり性格は落ち着き、自分の感情を押し殺すことが多く、余り周りに自分のことを素直に言うことが苦手である。年頃な年齢でもあるがために性的なことにも多少興味を持っている。今回のクリスマスはいつもとは違ったメンバーと迎えるのでちょっと興奮気味。さらに、プレゼント交換やクリスマスケーキなど、いつも以上にイベント感が強まっている為に余計そわそわしている。","en":"Ange, she/her: She is a modified human created by the United States, implanted with the powers of demons and Taimanin. She doesn't transform, but when she buries enemies she unfolds her back, releasing countless tentacles that annihilate foes. Raised as a soldier in American facilities, she has honed special skills and amassed varied combat experience. She excels in group battles, laying waste to endless enemies. Because only adults ever surround her and no one treats her as an equal, she remains calm, often suppressing her emotions, and finds it hard to speak openly about herself. Though she's of age, she harbors a modest curiosity about sexual matters. This Christmas, she's excited to spend the holiday with an unfamiliar group, and the added festivities—gift exchanges and Christmas cake—make her even more restless."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"三十三七","forms":[{"id":"uni00148_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[988,1976],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[138,276],"def":[119,238],"spd":[49,49],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","70007"]},{"id":"uni00148_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1476,2952],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[211,422],"def":[173,346],"spd":[49,49],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","70007","70